WEBVTT

00:00.420 --> 00:02.110
Huh? An exam?

00:02.110 --> 00:03.060
Yeah.

00:03.060 --> 00:05.590
A school official suddenly 
showed up at my door,

00:05.590 --> 00:08.830
and said I need to take a proficiency 
test before the entrance ceremony.

00:08.830 --> 00:11.120
But I refuse to be the one to take it.

00:11.120 --> 00:12.520
Huh, why not?

00:12.520 --> 00:16.550
Do you know how I felt, being stuck 
in this room for the last few days?

00:16.550 --> 00:17.690
Ah...

00:17.690 --> 00:21.000
Well, I thought I'd be exempt 
from that, which was my error.

00:21.000 --> 00:23.790
Wait, this might be my chance.

00:23.790 --> 00:25.680
What are these answers?!

00:25.680 --> 00:27.480
Get out of here!

00:27.480 --> 00:30.870
If I flaunt my utter 
incompetence on the test...

00:30.870 --> 00:34.140
It'd be possible to get kicked out 
before the entrance ceremony.

00:34.140 --> 00:35.380
I see.

00:36.770 --> 00:39.420
If I can manage that, 
I'll have nothing left to do here.

00:39.420 --> 00:40.450
Okay.

00:40.450 --> 00:42.420
I'll take care of this in no time!

00:57.580 --> 00:59.320
<i>Safely made it to the entrance!</i>

00:59.660 --> 01:01.430
Oh, you there.

01:01.690 --> 01:05.910
Um, would you be Haruto, 
the son of Margrave Zenfis?

01:05.910 --> 01:08.090
Ah, yes.

01:11.460 --> 01:13.310
We've been expecting you.

01:13.310 --> 01:14.920
Come now, follow me.

01:19.500 --> 01:22.720
<i>Whoa, amazing!</i>

01:19.760 --> 01:20.760
<b>Whoa...</b>

01:22.720 --> 01:25.670
<i>I bet this classroom could 
fit a hundred people!</i>

01:25.930 --> 01:28.220
<i>I'll be in this classroom 
starting in the spring?</i>

01:28.220 --> 01:31.930
<i>Do you think I'll be able 
to make lots of friends?</i>

01:33.130 --> 01:35.080
<i>Such a terrifying reality...</i>

01:33.730 --> 01:38.160
<b>Thud</b>

01:35.080 --> 01:36.200
<i>I can't handle it!</i>

01:35.080 --> 01:36.700
What's the matter?

01:36.700 --> 01:38.150
Are you all right?!

01:38.480 --> 01:39.960
Ah, yes.

01:39.960 --> 01:40.970
<i>Shoot.</i>

01:40.970 --> 01:43.990
<i>My life is being drained by 
this extrovert environment.</i>

01:43.990 --> 01:47.550
<i>I need to do everything 
I can to fail this exam!</i>

01:49.900 --> 01:52.180
Feel free to take your 
time with these questions.

01:53.140 --> 01:54.290
<i>Okay!</i>

01:54.290 --> 01:57.060
<i>Time to answer everything wrong 
and get out of here quick!</i>

02:02.900 --> 02:04.340
<i>I don't know any of this.</i>

02:05.300 --> 02:07.130
<i>Well, darn.</i>

02:07.130 --> 02:09.330
<i>I can't even tell what they're asking.</i>

02:09.330 --> 02:11.650
<i>Hmm, in that case...</i>

02:11.650 --> 02:14.360
<b>I really don't have a clue here</b>

02:12.130 --> 02:14.070
<i>Let's just put down, "No clue."</i>

02:16.360 --> 02:19.030
<b>Easy Going</b>

02:16.640 --> 02:19.030
<i>I've finished a third of this.</i>

02:19.600 --> 02:21.740
<i>Next is barrier magic, huh?</i>

02:22.120 --> 02:25.650
<i>They might catch on if I 
pretend not to know anything.</i>

02:25.650 --> 02:27.760
<i>Guess I should answer some of these.</i>

02:27.760 --> 02:31.860
<i>Um, barriers you create can move.</i>

02:31.860 --> 02:34.120
<i>In fact, you can even give them colors.</i>

02:32.420 --> 02:36.550
<b>Colorful</b>

02:34.120 --> 02:36.220
<i>Mana isn't required to sustain them.</i>

02:37.380 --> 02:38.530
<i>Okay.</i>

02:38.530 --> 02:40.960
<i>I don't think they'll give me points 
for such half-assed answers.</i>

02:42.170 --> 02:44.710
<i>Last up is ancient magic.</i>

02:45.190 --> 02:49.600
<i>I read up on it a while ago as my
 excuse for being a recluse.</i>

02:49.820 --> 02:55.480
<i>Oh, yeah, I loved reading stuff from that 
one author with the really long name.</i>

02:57.090 --> 02:58.140
<i>Oh, no!</i>

02:58.140 --> 02:59.890
<i>I wrote so much without thinking!</i>

03:01.150 --> 03:04.790
Now, then, let us switch rooms 
for your mana level assessment.

03:04.790 --> 03:05.300
Huh?

03:05.630 --> 03:08.490
Actually, my mana level is 2,

03:08.490 --> 03:10.340
so there's no need to bother 
with an assessment.

03:10.340 --> 03:11.450
My apologies.

03:11.450 --> 03:13.500
That's just our policy...

03:13.810 --> 03:16.020
<i>Well, if they check it directly,</i>

03:16.020 --> 03:19.470
<i>I guess they'll know just how useless I am.</i>

03:20.230 --> 03:22.700
Doctor, I've brought him.

03:24.310 --> 03:28.030
Yes, good work, Polkos.

03:29.160 --> 03:31.880
I hear a voice, even though no one's here.

03:31.880 --> 03:34.350
Look down, I say, down!

03:40.210 --> 03:42.610
You must be Haruto.

04:02.470 --> 04:05.850
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

05:14.370 --> 05:19.920
m 0 0 l 50 0 l 45 13 l -5 13

05:14.370 --> 05:19.920
Episode 9

05:14.370 --> 05:19.920
<b>The Entrance Ceremony Hullabaloo</b>

05:18.150 --> 05:20.480
Yeah! Dark hair is so pretty!

05:20.480 --> 05:22.000
I like your face, too!

05:22.000 --> 05:25.330
<i>Wh-What's the deal with this runt?</i>

05:27.120 --> 05:30.380
My name is Tearietta Luseiannel.

05:30.380 --> 05:33.190
I research ancient magic at this school.

05:33.190 --> 05:35.840
"Huh? This little kid is a professor?"

05:35.840 --> 05:37.600
I bet that's what you're thinking.

05:37.600 --> 05:39.580
How insolent of you!

05:39.580 --> 05:40.820
<i>Stop reading people's minds!</i>

05:40.820 --> 05:42.190
Moving on.

05:42.190 --> 05:44.540
Even with the king's recommendation,

05:44.540 --> 05:49.380
get on my bad side, and I'll send you 
back home before the entrance ceremony.

05:49.380 --> 05:50.450
For real?!

05:50.450 --> 05:51.900
O-Oh!

05:51.900 --> 05:54.820
That outburst didn't seem inspired by fear,

05:51.910 --> 05:56.620
Ba-dump

05:54.820 --> 05:57.060
but rather exuberant with high hopes!

05:57.060 --> 05:59.120
<i>You're absolutely right!</i>

05:59.120 --> 06:01.790
I can't say that I hate 
eccentric men like you...

06:01.790 --> 06:04.710
My chest is swelling up in excitement!

06:05.950 --> 06:07.970
Hey, just where are you looking?!

06:07.970 --> 06:10.380
I bet you just thought, 
"There's no swelling at all!"

06:10.380 --> 06:11.300
<i>Yeah...</i>

06:11.300 --> 06:16.510
But being ogled by a young boy 
like you isn't so bad, either!

06:16.510 --> 06:19.720
<i>How long is this charade going to continue?</i>

06:20.210 --> 06:23.310
Doctor, if we could get 
to the matter at hand.

06:23.310 --> 06:25.180
Oh, you're right.

06:26.870 --> 06:30.260
I'll go ahead and confirm 
your magical knowledge.

06:30.560 --> 06:31.950
Mm-hmm.

06:36.090 --> 06:38.430
Let's proceed with the assessment.

06:38.430 --> 06:41.950
<i>Oh, did she get angry at my garbage answers?</i>

06:45.310 --> 06:48.510
<i>Well, the result is still going to be a 2.</i>

06:48.850 --> 06:50.000
<i>Let's go.</i>

07:03.780 --> 07:04.640
Huh?

07:04.640 --> 07:07.000
Seriously? This piece of junk!

07:07.000 --> 07:08.350
<i>No way!</i>

07:08.350 --> 07:11.490
<i>I thought this crystal 
ball was a precious item!</i>

07:11.880 --> 07:13.870
<i>The fact that I broke it means...</i>

07:13.870 --> 07:16.360
<i>She must be pretty pissed off!</i>

07:16.360 --> 07:17.820
<i>Yes, yes!</i>

07:17.820 --> 07:20.920
<i>Give in to your anger and 
order me to go back home!</i>

07:21.660 --> 07:22.460
S...

07:22.460 --> 07:23.510
<i>Yes, go on.</i>

07:24.210 --> 07:26.330
Spectacular!

07:26.880 --> 07:28.890
Did you see that, Polkos?

07:28.890 --> 07:30.960
He shattered the Mija's Crystal!

07:30.960 --> 07:35.090
This is proof that he possesses so much 
magic, the crystal couldn't handle it!

07:35.090 --> 07:37.220
H-Hold on, Doctor.

07:37.220 --> 07:41.060
I heard that his maximum mana level was 2!

07:41.060 --> 07:43.900
Nope, I'm not buying that.

07:43.900 --> 07:46.010
There are exceptions to everything.

07:46.010 --> 07:47.250
Besides...

07:47.650 --> 07:50.870
we still don't understand the underlying 
logic behind Mija's Crystals!

07:50.870 --> 07:55.310
As magical researchers, we must pursue that 
matter before we can talk about his power!

07:55.310 --> 07:58.160
And that's not all, you see.

07:58.160 --> 07:59.110
Yes.

07:59.110 --> 08:02.890
Problems at a royal magician level 
were a bit too advanced, I see.

08:03.320 --> 08:04.170
<i>Royal?</i>

08:04.170 --> 08:07.880
The courage to put down 
"no clue" for every answer...

08:08.400 --> 08:10.170
What a breath of fresh air!

08:10.170 --> 08:11.460
I like it!

08:12.170 --> 08:15.630
And his explanations of barrier 
magic are simply splendid!

08:15.630 --> 08:18.560
Great answers for the ancient 
magic portion, too!

08:18.560 --> 08:22.130
They're practically perfect 
copies of my own writing!

08:22.320 --> 08:24.180
<i>"My own writing"?</i>

08:24.780 --> 08:26.010
<i>Ah!</i>

08:26.010 --> 08:29.820
<i>She was the author with the 
name that was way too long!</i>

08:28.820 --> 08:29.820
<b>Shock</b>

08:30.260 --> 08:31.990
I've made up my mind, Polkos.

08:32.730 --> 08:34.930
I'll be taking him under my wing!

08:34.930 --> 08:39.110
I'd never let the other professors 
have someone so interesting!

08:39.110 --> 08:41.230
Keep this matter strictly between us.

08:41.230 --> 08:41.990
Okay?

08:41.990 --> 08:45.340
You were the one who did all 
this by yourself to begin with!

08:45.680 --> 08:47.640
<i>Hey, hold on a minute.</i>

08:47.640 --> 08:51.170
<i>Have they just been toying 
with me this whole time?!</i>

08:51.950 --> 08:54.070
There you have it, Haruto.

08:54.070 --> 08:55.810
Join me in my research!

08:55.810 --> 08:56.890
No way!

08:55.930 --> 08:56.890
<b>Sternly</b>

09:00.130 --> 09:01.200
Come now!

09:01.200 --> 09:03.540
My research lab specializes 
in ancient magic!

09:03.540 --> 09:05.350
I promise you'll spend a 
fulfilling five years...

09:05.350 --> 09:06.820
No way in hell!

09:09.260 --> 09:10.740
I'll be taking my leave.

09:10.740 --> 09:12.470
Wait right there!

09:12.810 --> 09:16.160
Haruto!

09:21.880 --> 09:23.630
That's what happened.

09:23.630 --> 09:24.870
The rest is in your hands.

09:25.090 --> 09:26.950
Don't give me that!

09:26.950 --> 09:30.500
I don't want to hear it from someone making 
a good impression from the very start!

09:33.370 --> 09:35.160
I may have failed this time...

09:35.160 --> 09:37.190
But we haven't given up yet!

09:41.600 --> 09:42.970
<b>Am I Actually the Strongest?</b>

09:49.390 --> 09:51.230
Copy Haruto.

09:51.230 --> 09:53.230
Here, from Haruto.

09:53.830 --> 09:56.650
Best of luck to you in 
carrying out your duties.

10:02.590 --> 10:05.290
I don't wanna go to the entrance ceremony.

10:05.700 --> 10:07.240
<i>I'm Haruto C.</i>

10:07.240 --> 10:10.780
<i>I'm supposed to go to the entrance 
ceremony in his place today.</i>

10:10.780 --> 10:13.870
<i>The two of us share all 
of our past memories.</i>

10:13.870 --> 10:18.300
<i>However, I possess no magic, 
and I'm just an empty vessel.</i>

10:18.300 --> 10:20.710
<i>At least I had him cast 
defensive magic on me.</i>

10:20.980 --> 10:23.680
<i>And this is for self-defense, huh?</i>

10:23.900 --> 10:26.080
<i>I'm nothing more than a copy.</i>

10:26.080 --> 10:28.390
<i>I have no choice in the matter.</i>

10:26.180 --> 10:28.390
<b>Two...</b>

10:29.390 --> 10:30.630
Off I go...

10:41.870 --> 10:42.910
<i>Woo!</i>

10:42.910 --> 10:44.630
<i>Done with all the events for the day!</i>

10:44.630 --> 10:46.690
<i>Better get back to my dorm room!</i>

10:53.550 --> 10:55.460
<i>A-A swarm of extroverts!</i>

10:55.720 --> 10:57.930
<i>I can feel it in my bones!</i>

10:57.930 --> 11:01.050
<i>Nothing good can come out of 
getting involved with them!</i>

11:01.470 --> 11:02.300
<b>Shuffle shuffle</b>

11:01.970 --> 11:02.300
<b>Scrunch</b>

11:05.350 --> 11:07.240
Hey. You there.

11:08.230 --> 11:10.710
You with the white hair!

11:11.200 --> 11:12.980
<i>He didn't mean me!</i>

11:12.980 --> 11:15.160
<i>In that case, let's book it!</i>

11:23.360 --> 11:24.270
<i>Eh?</i>

11:24.270 --> 11:26.270
<i>What's she doing at this academy?</i>

11:26.520 --> 11:27.870
You're...

11:28.150 --> 11:30.500
Hey. You two.

11:31.700 --> 11:35.530
You would walk past me without 
so much as a salute?

11:36.750 --> 11:38.720
My apologies.

11:38.720 --> 11:42.460
But I don't recall anything of the 
sort in the academy handbook.

11:43.440 --> 11:44.530
No!

11:44.530 --> 11:48.520
I'm telling you to bow down to me,
 your vice president, Schneidel!

11:48.520 --> 11:49.760
I'm sorry.

11:49.760 --> 11:52.210
I've just entered the academy today.

11:52.210 --> 11:54.240
Is that a part of the rules?

11:54.240 --> 11:56.930
I see now.

11:56.930 --> 11:58.460
You there, then!

11:58.460 --> 11:59.820
Explain it to her.

11:59.820 --> 12:01.280
<i>Huh?!</i>

12:01.280 --> 12:02.850
<i>Hell if I know!</i>

12:02.850 --> 12:05.850
<i>And I don't actually want to spend 
any more time with these people,</i>

12:05.850 --> 12:08.360
<i>so time to make up an 
excuse to get out of here!</i>

12:09.820 --> 12:10.700
Ah!

12:10.700 --> 12:12.360
Ow, ow, ow, ow!

12:12.360 --> 12:13.490
Ugh, my stomach!

12:13.490 --> 12:14.300
I'm about to burst!

12:14.300 --> 12:15.600
Can I get going now?!

12:15.840 --> 12:17.780
H-How dare you?!

12:17.780 --> 12:20.340
You mock me with your vulgar lies?!

12:20.670 --> 12:21.700
You'll pay for this!

12:21.700 --> 12:24.980
I'll beat some manners into you directly!

12:25.850 --> 12:26.860
<i>Magic?!</i>

12:26.860 --> 12:28.780
<i>That thing will kill me if it hits me!</i>

12:28.780 --> 12:32.320
It's far too late to run away!

12:44.700 --> 12:47.890
Repent for your actions here.

12:50.900 --> 12:53.030
Man, that scared me!

12:53.030 --> 12:54.580
<i>Thank goodness!</i>

12:54.580 --> 12:56.530
<i>That defensive barrier worked!</i>

12:56.530 --> 12:58.570
<i>Thank you, original self.</i>

12:58.570 --> 13:00.390
<i>My uniform's not looking too hot, though.</i>

13:01.340 --> 13:03.500
Not a scratch after that attack?!

13:03.500 --> 13:04.840
<i>Ah, whoops.</i>

13:04.840 --> 13:06.750
<i>I should have pretended to be in pain.</i>

13:07.940 --> 13:10.040
It came a little late, but the pain!

13:10.040 --> 13:11.480
Agh! It hurts!

13:11.480 --> 13:13.250
It hurts so bad!

13:13.690 --> 13:14.800
That's absurd!

13:14.800 --> 13:16.650
How can you still stand?!

13:16.650 --> 13:18.560
<i>My acting was the least 
of the problems here.</i>

13:25.730 --> 13:29.860
I've assessed the situation and 
thought about what action to take.

13:30.240 --> 13:35.670
Here, I believe it'd be best to apologize 
for getting you caught up in all of this.

13:35.670 --> 13:37.110
I'm sorry.

13:37.110 --> 13:38.630
<i>Huh? After all that?</i>

13:38.630 --> 13:42.490
As a second option, I came up 
with an idea to quell his anger.

13:42.790 --> 13:47.620
However, I still can't 
understand why he's angry.

13:49.460 --> 13:53.870
<i>I'm aware of how bad I am at 
communicating with others...</i>

13:54.180 --> 13:57.890
<i>but she's even worse at 
reading the room than I am!</i>

13:57.890 --> 14:00.320
D-Damn you!

14:00.320 --> 14:02.800
Damn you! Damn you!

14:02.800 --> 14:05.280
You've made enough of a fool of me!

14:05.280 --> 14:07.190
You mustn't, Lord Schneidel!

14:07.190 --> 14:08.420
You'll end up killing them!

14:08.420 --> 14:09.500
Shut up!

14:09.500 --> 14:10.690
<i>Whoa there!</i>

14:10.690 --> 14:11.870
<i>That's bad news!</i>

14:11.870 --> 14:13.500
Run away! Quickly!

14:13.500 --> 14:14.880
Take this!

14:29.380 --> 14:31.760
<i>Time to run away as fast as I can!</i>

14:30.020 --> 14:33.300
My arm! My arm!

14:40.470 --> 14:42.770
That sure sounds rough.

14:43.490 --> 14:47.330
<i>Afterwards, I was also chased around 
by that pint-sized professor.</i>

14:47.330 --> 14:48.140
Oh!

14:48.140 --> 14:50.190
If it isn't Haruto!

14:50.190 --> 14:53.120
Won't you stop by my room for some tea?

14:53.120 --> 14:55.820
Haruto!

14:58.240 --> 15:00.760
You go and get some rest.

15:00.760 --> 15:01.650
Okay...

15:04.290 --> 15:07.220
<i>A magic battle with no warning, though?</i>

15:07.220 --> 15:09.130
<i>Something's wrong with this school!</i>

15:18.510 --> 15:19.760
I refuse!

15:21.750 --> 15:25.760
This is a duel conforming to 
noble etiquette, you know!

15:25.760 --> 15:29.610
Reject it, and you'll bring dishonor 
to Margrave Zenfis, as well!

15:29.610 --> 15:30.950
<i>Seriously?</i>

15:30.950 --> 15:36.860
Also, if you lose on purpose, you'll meet 
a worse fate than if you'd rejected it.

15:36.860 --> 15:39.030
In any case, you'd do well 
to give it your all.

15:47.170 --> 15:48.420
<b>

15:48.760 --> 15:51.590
This has turned into a 
real pain in the butt!</b>

15:51.590 --> 15:54.090
I'm up against the vice president, right?

15:54.090 --> 15:57.020
I should assume that he's pretty skilled.

15:57.260 --> 16:01.210
<i>I'm sure my copy ended up 
unharmed because he went easy.</i>

16:01.210 --> 16:05.900
<i>Right now, I can only come up with 
plans where I lose hideously!</i>

16:05.900 --> 16:07.610
<i>But I don't want to get hurt!</i>

16:07.820 --> 16:09.230
<b>Hmmmm...</b>

16:11.510 --> 16:12.310
<i>Huh?</i>

16:12.700 --> 16:14.590
<i>What is </i>she<i> up to?</i>

16:19.870 --> 16:20.900
<i>Eh?</i>

16:20.900 --> 16:22.950
<i>Is she going to go to 
that noble kid's house?</i>

16:28.000 --> 16:30.510
m 0 0 l 86 0 l 86 126 l 0 126

16:28.000 --> 16:30.510
<b>Center of
the
Royal Capital,
Marquis Hafen
Estate</b>

16:38.900 --> 16:39.930
What?

16:39.930 --> 16:42.390
Call off the duel?

16:42.600 --> 16:43.600
That's right.

16:43.600 --> 16:45.770
The blame for everything lies with me.

16:46.000 --> 16:50.510
It looks like you've suffered 
serious injuries from his attack.

16:50.510 --> 16:52.820
In any case, you're in 
no shape for a duel—

16:52.820 --> 16:53.440
Shut your mouth!

16:55.340 --> 16:57.730
Can't you heal faster, you slowpoke?!

16:58.060 --> 16:59.560
My apologies!

17:00.380 --> 17:02.250
<i>What's his deal?</i>

17:02.250 --> 17:04.460
<i>He's the quintessential 
image of a big, fat jerk!</i>

17:04.770 --> 17:09.440
<i>Or well, what's she thinking, 
going alone to a place like that?</i>

17:09.790 --> 17:14.020
To begin with, you're asking for 
a favor without even an apology?

17:14.020 --> 17:15.500
Know your place!

17:15.810 --> 17:17.070
I see.

17:17.070 --> 17:18.990
Excuse me for my ignorance.

17:19.410 --> 17:20.510
Please, I beg of you.

17:20.850 --> 17:22.060
It's futile!

17:22.060 --> 17:23.700
How utterly futile!

17:23.700 --> 17:27.180
There's no point at all 
if you feel no shame!

17:27.510 --> 17:29.530
What should I do, then?

17:29.860 --> 17:31.280
Let me think.

17:32.930 --> 17:35.820
Why don't you dance naked, right here?

17:35.820 --> 17:39.830
N-Not even I can agree to that...

17:40.300 --> 17:41.850
What's wrong?

17:41.850 --> 17:45.290
Is it not a small price to pay 
to find me in good humor?

17:48.540 --> 17:49.600
Very well.

17:49.600 --> 17:50.380
<i>What?!</i>

17:53.110 --> 17:54.070
<i>Eh?</i>

17:54.070 --> 17:55.350
<i>She's not serious, right?</i>

18:13.030 --> 18:14.400
What's wrong?

18:14.400 --> 18:16.030
Your hands are trembling.

18:16.030 --> 18:19.150
I can ask them to help you, if you want.

18:19.750 --> 18:22.420
N-No, there's no need.

18:34.650 --> 18:35.950
<i>Ah!</i>

18:35.950 --> 18:38.120
<i>Why would you go that far?!</i>

18:38.120 --> 18:39.970
<i>How air-headed can you be?!</i>

18:46.830 --> 18:47.680
What?

18:47.680 --> 18:48.970
What's happening?

18:52.030 --> 18:54.640
I-It's you, from back then!

18:57.920 --> 19:00.460
Have some respect for yourself!

19:00.950 --> 19:02.140
For crying out loud!

19:02.140 --> 19:03.900
You're way too defenseless!

19:04.240 --> 19:05.430
I'll fly you back to the dorms,

19:05.430 --> 19:07.410
so put some clothes on at once and go home!

19:07.410 --> 19:09.000
Eh? Ah, wait!

19:09.000 --> 19:09.830
So long!

19:12.040 --> 19:12.940
Hey!

19:12.940 --> 19:14.130
What's going on?

19:14.130 --> 19:15.880
Turn the lights on immediately!

19:15.880 --> 19:17.590
Is anyone there?!

19:17.590 --> 19:20.720
We're in a special dimension, 
so no one's coming to help.

19:20.720 --> 19:22.650
Wh-Who are you?!

19:22.650 --> 19:23.920
How did you do this?!

19:23.920 --> 19:26.570
I am Shiva, the enforcer of justice!

19:26.940 --> 19:28.380
I'm here to punish you for your sins!

19:28.560 --> 19:30.060
My sins?

19:30.060 --> 19:31.520
You must be kidding me!

19:37.190 --> 19:39.890
Wh-What's happening?!

19:39.890 --> 19:41.730
D-Damn you!

19:41.730 --> 19:43.000
What did you do?!

19:43.000 --> 19:47.340
For the sins you've committed, 
I've placed a Vise Block on you.

19:47.570 --> 19:49.950
Let me elaborate on three of your sins!

19:51.720 --> 19:56.830
First, unfairly picking a fight with a 
new student and causing a commotion.

19:57.400 --> 20:01.040
I'm next in line to be head of the Hafen 
family, as well as vice president.

20:01.040 --> 20:05.140
Upperclassmen are permitted to 
give guidance to underclassmen!

20:05.610 --> 20:07.370
Guidance, huh?

20:07.370 --> 20:10.470
In other words, it was your 
own arbitrary decision.

20:11.950 --> 20:13.720
Second, the duel.

20:13.720 --> 20:16.910
How despicable, trying to publicly punish 
an underclassman with no warning.

20:16.910 --> 20:18.710
Th-That's absurd!

20:18.710 --> 20:21.650
It's a perfectly respectable way 
to protect the honor of a noble—

20:21.650 --> 20:22.830
C'mon now.

20:22.830 --> 20:25.320
If I say that it's wrong, then it's wrong!

20:25.320 --> 20:27.160
That's pure tyranny right there!

20:27.160 --> 20:28.040
Huh?

20:28.040 --> 20:29.880
Didn't you try and do 
basically the same thing?

20:31.550 --> 20:32.790
And finally...

20:33.230 --> 20:35.560
You really shouldn't sexually harass girls!

20:35.560 --> 20:37.050
Dancing naked?

20:37.050 --> 20:39.300
Have you no shame saying that out loud?

20:41.770 --> 20:43.260
For those reasons!

20:43.260 --> 20:45.830
You'll be living with that for a while.

20:46.940 --> 20:50.360
If you use magic or try and take 
it off, it'll clamp down tighter.

20:50.360 --> 20:51.360
So be careful.

20:51.650 --> 20:52.810
Extro patro...

20:55.720 --> 20:57.900
Seriously, I just told you not to!

20:58.140 --> 21:01.870
Call off the duel, since you won't be 
able to fight in two days like this.

21:01.870 --> 21:04.520
I'll take it off once you've 
atoned for your sins.

21:04.520 --> 21:05.360
See you!

21:12.980 --> 21:14.110
We're back in the room!

21:14.110 --> 21:14.670
What?!

21:14.670 --> 21:16.140
Lord Schneidel?!

21:16.140 --> 21:17.400
What in the world happened?!

21:18.030 --> 21:20.220
Tend to his wounds! Hurry!

21:21.670 --> 21:22.710
N-No, don't!

21:23.390 --> 21:25.060
Lord Schneidel?!

21:27.290 --> 21:29.760
Hey, stop laughing!

21:29.760 --> 21:31.650
Can you blame me?

21:34.520 --> 21:35.980
Shiva!

21:35.980 --> 21:38.630
You won't get away with this!

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
m 0 0 l 110 0 l 102 22 l 0 22

23:08.990 --> 23:24.000
Episode Preview

23:09.740 --> 23:11.200
Charlotte here!

23:11.200 --> 23:13.710
I hope Haruto is staying safe at school.

23:12.870 --> 23:14.490
<b>Blush</b>

23:12.870 --> 23:14.490
<b>Blush</b>

23:13.710 --> 23:16.380
I'm worried, since I hear it's a scary place.

23:16.380 --> 23:18.910
What if someone is after his life?!

23:18.910 --> 23:20.630
Next episode:
"The Demon King's Name".

23:19.370 --> 23:24.000
<b>The Demon King's Name</b>

23:20.630 --> 23:21.230
What?!

23:21.230 --> 23:22.840
Th-Th-The Demon King?!
